      "line_end": 2,
      "severity": "high",
      "description": "Unconditional addition of 50 before floor division causes incorrect rounding for negative products. The contract requires exact halves to be rounded away from zero and mandates percent_of(-x, p) == -percent_of(x, p).",
      "evidence": "For amount_cents=-1, percent=50, the product is -50. The candidate computes (-50 + 50) // 100 = 0, but the contract requires -1 (rounding -0.5 away from zero). This violates symmetry with percent_of(1, 50) == 1."
    }
  ]
